flowchart TD
    A[Raw input signals] --> B[Single rule is too weak]
    B --> C[Small combinations are formed first]
    C --> D[Larger state pattern is formed next]
    D --> E[Final decision uses the staged combination]

    F[Raw image cues] --> G[Valve, beacon, pipe cues stay separate]
    G --> H[Front layer builds small visual combinations]
    H --> I[Later layer builds larger equipment meaning]
    I --> J[Final label becomes more stable]
